    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harry Brann Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market, this 3 bedroomed detached bungalow built on an elevated circa 0.86-acre site, boasting panoramic views of the surrounding countryside & located circa 6.9kms from the village of Toomevara - set in tranquil surroundings, the property represents an ideal starter or down-sizer home for the would-be purchaser - Early viewing recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation to include - Entrance Hall, Lounge, Kitchen/Dining Area, 3 Bedrooms, Family Bathroom & Utility."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 4.92m x 1.0m \r\n+ 3.76m x 1.80m. Laminated oak timber floor. Fully shelved hot-press. Wall light.\r\n\r\nLounge - 4.84m x 4.13m \r\n2.31m x 0.45m. Laminated oak timber floor. Open fire in timber surround fireplace with cast iron insert. Picture-view bay window. TV point.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area - 6.37m x 3.34m \r\nCeramic tiled floor. Fully fitted units to include extractor & breakfast counter. Over-counter tiling. Dual aspect windows to include sliding PVC door to side garden. Timber ceiling with recessed lighting. TV point.\r\n\r\nUtility - 2.51m x 1.8m \r\nCeramic tiled floor. Plumbed for washing machine & dryer. Rear door access. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.65m x 3.01m \r\nLaminated oak timber floor. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.62m x 3.56m \r\nLaminated oak timber floor. Bult-in open wardrobes. TV point. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.84m x 3.8m \r\nLaminated oka timber floor. Built-in open wardrobes. \r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom - 3.3m x 1.95m \r\nCeramic tiled floor & fully tiled around shower area. Large electric shower, corner bath, WC & WHB. Timber ceiling with recessed lighting. Attic access \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Services to include - Oil fired central heating (boiler upgraded in 2024). Private well & septic tank. Fibre broadband.\r\nPVC double glazed windows & side/rear entrance doors. Hardwood front entrance door. \r\nLawned gardens to the front, side & rear. Gravelled driveway. Timber garden shed. Outside tap.\r\nLocated - 11.1kms from J23, M7 Motorway, 12.2kms from Templemore & 18.3kms from Nenagh.  \r\nThe property is located 2km from Gurtagarry Primary School.\r\nBuilt in 1997"
      },
      {
